## Open Questions & Decisions

> [!WARNING]
> **Decision Required**: Gemini's explicit Context Caching requires a minimum token threshold (typically 32,768 tokens for Gemini 1.5/2.5 models). For notes below this size, standard caching is bypassed by the API. We will implement **Implicit Caching** as a baseline and only trigger the **Explicit Cache Manager** when the note + combined RAG context exceeds 32k tokens.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **LLM Grader Cost vs. Accuracy**: Because LLM-as-a-Judge (Phase 4C) uses an additional LLM call, it increases API cost. By combining it with **Context Caching (Phase 5A)**, the cost per grade drops by 90%, making high-fidelity grading extremely affordable.

> [!NOTE]
> **Flashcard spaced formatting**: Do you prefer spaced repetition cards output in standard Obsidian Flashcards community format (`Question == Answer` or `Q ?? A` format)? The blueprint standardizes on `Q ?? A` as it is widely supported across Markdown flashcard engines.


